  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMESA Public Procurement Reform (IDF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a regional framework to promote the harmonization of public procurement systems among COMESA member states and to develop a cadre of professionals in the area of public procurement. Contribute to the establishment of fair and transparent procurement systems in two pilot COMESA member states (Rwanda and Zambia) by:  (a) consolidation of legal and regulatory reforms; (b) capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
